<title>SINGAPORE: DBS, OCBC give US$48 mln loan.</title>
<headline>DBS, OCBC give US$48 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>DBS Bank Ltd and OCBC Bank Ltd said on Friday they were jointly giving a loan of US$48 million to finance the construction of Pidemco Tower in Shanghai, China.  </p>
<p>DBS Bank statement said the loan facility was for five years, but gave no further details.</p>
<p>Pidemco Tower is an office and commerical complex being developed by Shanghai Huteng Real Estate Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Shanghai Huteng is a joint venture between Singapore's Pidemco Land Ltd, Lim Kah Ngam Ltd and Natsteel Ltd.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
